<title>USA: Chartwell Re Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Chartwell Re Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(dollars in thousands except earnings per share):</p>
<p>						     Three Month Periods</p>
<p>							Ended March 31,</p>
<p>						     1997	1996 (1)</p>
<p> Gross premiums written		     $96,676     $68,564</p>
<p> Ceded premiums written			26,764	18,846</p>
<p>						     69,912	49,718</p>
<p> Net income					 6,487	 4,834</p>
<p>Per Share Data:</p>
<p> Operating income per common share	   0.68	  0.56</p>
<p> Net income  per common share		  0.68	  0.64</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding  9,596,172   7,581,033</p>
<p> GAAP Combined Ratio			  101.70%     105.20%</p>
<p>NOTE: (1) Includes the results of Chartwell prior to the acquisition of Archer Group Holdings plc which occurred at the end of November 1996.</p>
